  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet KBV-VS-MIO-LAB-Specimen-Condition</b></p><a name=\"KBV-VS-MIO-LAB-Specimen-Condition\"> </a><a name=\"hcKBV-VS-MIO-LAB-Specimen-Condition\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/version/20251115\"> version ?http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/version/20251115</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/id/710070002\">710070002</a></td><td>Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to broken container</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/id/448140007\">448140007</a></td><td>Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to obscuring lubricant jelly</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/id/712743008\">712743008</a></td><td>Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to improper storage of specimen</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/id/448141006\">448141006</a></td><td>Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to marked cellular degeneration</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000274103/id/373881006\">373881006</a></td><td>Unsatisfactory for evaluation due to lack of patient identification on specimen and/or requisition form</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0493</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 3.0.0\"> version ?3.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-AUT\">AUT</a></td><td>Autolyzed</td><td>Autolyzed</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CLOT\">CLOT</a></td><td>Clotted</td><td>Clotted</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CON\">CON</a></td><td>Contaminated</td><td>Contaminated</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-COOL\">COOL</a></td><td>Cool</td><td>Cool</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-FROZ\">FROZ</a></td><td>Frozen</td><td>Frozen</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-HEM\">HEM</a></td><td>Hemolyzed</td><td>Hemolyzed</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-LIVE\">LIVE</a></td><td>Live</td><td>Live</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-ROOM\">ROOM</a></td><td>Room Temperature</td><td>Room temperature</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-SNR\">SNR</a></td><td>Sample not received</td><td>Sample not received</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CFU\">CFU</a></td><td>Centrifuged</td><td>Centrifuged</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
